# Fusecheck fixture (scripts/fusecheck-check.sh --selftest): every row must
# PASS. The legacy one-sided floor and the =N exact sugar against the
# separable fixture (measured 2 bodies — the selftest re-measures before
# trusting these rows).
assert fusecheck-fixtures-separable.stl 2
assert fusecheck-fixtures-separable.stl =2
# Mandatory negative control: the fused fixture stays 1 body (<= 1), so the
# check can fire.
control fused 1
